          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Pick what kind of drug you are trying to make. Each project accepts a different\nset of property ranges: a brain drug cannot afford to be pumped out at the\nblood-brain barrier, a muscle drug cares about how much stays free in muscle.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Then pick a molecule, and see whether its nine pegs fit.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
