            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>How to read it.</strong> The shaded band is what this project will accept. The bar is\nwhat our model predicts. The pale tip on the bar is how much the five models in\nthe ensemble disagreed. The dashed line, where it appears, is the value someone\nactually measured in a lab.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The gap between the bar and the dashed line is the model being wrong. Keep an\neye on it -- the rest of this notebook is about when that gap opens up.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Kclp",
      "code_hash": "6a3e436b89e180479e57053b23ad7daf",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"how-many-real-molecules-actually-click\">How many real molecules actually click?</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Every molecule here was made by a chemist who wanted it to work. Applying each\nproject's full requirement list to the model's predictions for all\n<strong>7,608</strong> of them:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='Kclp-0' random-id='e3e6125a-f9b6-4a5d-e23a-74176585f557'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;project&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Oral drug&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;requirements&#92;&quot;:6,&#92;&quot;molecules that click&#92;&quot;:1521,&#92;&quot;share&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;20.0%&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;project&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Brain drug&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;requirements&#92;&quot;:6,&#92;&quot;molecules that click&#92;&quot;:1052,&#92;&quot;share&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;13.8%&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;project&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Muscle drug&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;requirements&#92;&quot;:5,&#92;&quot;molecules that click&#92;&quot;:652,&#92;&quot;share&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;8.6%&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;project&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Everything at once&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;requirements&#92;&quot;:9,&#92;&quot;molecules that click&#92;&quot;:362,&#92;&quot;share&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;4.8%&#92;&quot;}]&quot;' data-total-rows='4' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='4' data-field-types='[[&quot;project&quot;,[&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;]],[&quot;requirements&quot;,[&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;int64&quot;]],[&quot;molecules that click&quot;,[&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;int64&quot;]],[&quot;share&quot;,[&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;]]]' data-show-filters='true' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Even on the loosest preset most molecules fail something. That is the job:\nnot optimising a property, but satisfying all of them at once -- what chemists\ncall <strong>whack-a-mole</strong>, because fixing one usually breaks another.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">And there is a second problem hiding in the data.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
